OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged after pedestrian hit
OL,4,Aduring pursuit
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 23-year-old man has been charged
OL,7,Fafter a pedestrian suffered
OL,8,Flife-threatening injuries in a crash
OL,9,Fthat happened during a police pursuit.
OL,11,FA patrol car in Taunton, Somerset,
OL,12,Factivated lights and sirens to follow
OL,13,Fan Audi A3 without a front number plate
OL,14,Fat 23:15 BST on 6 November.
OL,16,FPolice said a pedestrian, in their 70s,
OL,17,Fwas hit in the East Reach area of
OL,18,FTaunton town centre and is in hospital
OL,19,Fin a critical condition.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
