OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged after pedestrian hit
OL,4,Aduring pursuit
OL,5,
OL,6,FJack Hawkings, of Bramley Close,
OL,7,FWellington, has been charged with four
OL,8,Foffences; causing serious injury by
OL,9,Fdangerous driving, failing to stop for
OL,10,Fpolice and driving without insurance or
OL,11,Fa licence.
